  "title": "CNB Community Bancorp, Inc. Declares Quarterly Cash Dividend of $0.34 Per Share",
  "summary": "CNB Community Bancorp, Inc. (OTCQX:CNBB) announced that the Board of Directors has declared a quarterly cash dividend on the Company’s common stock in the amount of $0.34 per share, an increase of $0.03 per share from the dividend paid for the 2nd Quarter of 2025, payable on July 10, 2026 for shareholders of record on June 30, 2026. About CNB Community Bancorp, Inc. CNB Community Bancorp, Inc. (OTCQX:CNBB) is a one-bank holding company. Its subsidiary bank, County National Bank...",
